# One host, and it is the apex.
#
# The domain is registered as www.potatofarm.io, and every canonical tag,
# every sitemap entry and every Open Graph url in this site points at the
# apex. Both hosts resolving without a redirect is duplicate content:
# Google indexes two copies, splits the ranking between them, and the
# canonical tags then contradict the host the visitor is actually on.
#
# 301 and `!` — permanent, and forced ahead of any other rule.
https://www.potatofarm.io/*  https://potatofarm.io/:splat  301!

# Extensionless URLs, because that is what the site claims about itself.
#
# **Three of these were missing and it would have been live breakage.**
# The sitemap submits /trakheesi-permits, /uae-aml-for-brokerages and
# /whatsapp-24-hour-window to Google, and every one of those pages
# carries a canonical tag pointing at the extensionless form — but only
# five rules existed here, so all three fell through to the catch-all and
# returned 404.
#
# They are the guides. They are the entire content-marketing surface, the
# thing a brokerage owner finds when they search "Trakheesi permit
# expiry", and they would have been dead on day one while telling the
# search engine to index them.
#
# 200, not 301: the extensionless URL *is* the page, so it is a rewrite.
# A 301 to the .html would make the .html canonical and contradict every
# canonical tag on the site.
/product                   /product.html                   200
/security                  /security.html                  200
/demo                      /demo.html                      200
/guides                    /guides.html                    200
/legal                     /legal.html                     200
/trakheesi-permits         /trakheesi-permits.html         200
/uae-aml-for-brokerages    /uae-aml-for-brokerages.html    200
/whatsapp-24-hour-window   /whatsapp-24-hour-window.html   200

# The .html forms redirect to the canonical ones, so a link that escaped
# with the extension on it consolidates rather than competing.
/product.html                  /product                   301
/security.html                 /security                  301
/demo.html                     /demo                      301
/guides.html                   /guides                    301
/legal.html                    /legal                     301
/trakheesi-permits.html        /trakheesi-permits         301
/uae-aml-for-brokerages.html   /uae-aml-for-brokerages    301
/whatsapp-24-hour-window.html  /whatsapp-24-hour-window   301

# Anything else.
/*  /404.html  404
